;
; Transmit-only SPI mode 0 for the PicoCalc's SPI TFT. Two instructions, so
; one bit costs two SM cycles: SM clock = 2 x bit rate. MOSI changes while
; SCK is low and the panel samples it on the rising edge.
;
; Shape follows ~/Source/shapones (samples/v3/picocalc.pio), which drives this
; same panel at 75 MHz. That program also reads MISO; nothing here does, so
; the input half is dropped and the SM is TX-only.

.program picocalc_lcd
.side_set 1

.wrap_target
    out pins, 1     side 0
    nop             side 1
.wrap
